ookings and captures opportunities through your website and by phone.</li></ul><p class="funnel-fine">Includes 150 AI telephone minutes per month. Additional telephone usage is 25p/minute.</p><p class="funnel-fine">After the Initial Term: £179/month on a rolling monthly basis. Paid advertising is separate.</p><p class="funnel-fine">A.C.E is not VAT registered. No VAT is charged or added to the prices shown.</p></article></div><p class="landing-package-note">Once A.C.E has received all required information, content and access, the completed website will be ready for review within seven working days.</p></div></section><section class="landing-concept-first landing-concept-first--closing"><div class="funnel-wrap"><p class="funnel-eyebrow">YOUR CONCEPT COMES NEXT</p><h2>See what A.C.E could create before choosing anything.</h2><p class="funnel-lead">Your answers help us understand the business first. After our personalised recommendations, the complimentary concept questionnaire lets us shape a tailored website direction for you to review before deciding whether to continue.</p><a class="funnel-button landing-concept-button" href="https://acetailored.co.uk/acquisition/beauty-paid/">Answer 8 short questions <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><p class="funnel-fine">No payment. No obligation. No package decision today.</p></div></section></main><footer class="funnel-footer"><div class="funnel-wrap"><div class="funnel-footer-top"><img src="/_beauty/logo.png" width="1156" height="530" alt="A.C.E Tailored"><p>Tailored websites for owner-led beauty businesses.<br><small>ATTRACT · CONVERT · ENGAGE</small></p></div><nav aria-label="Service documents"><a href="https://start.acetailored.co.uk/legal/service-terms-complete-v005-20261111/">Service Terms</a><a href="https://start.acetailored.co.uk/legal/data-processing-complete-v005-20261110/">Data Processing Addendum (where applicable)</a><a href="https://start.acetailored.co.uk/legal/privacy-notice-complete-v004-20261110/">Privacy